    {
      "position": 2,
      "polarity": 0,
      "label": "六二",
      "text": {
        "id": "h53-yao-2",
        "original": "鸿渐于磐，饮食衎衎，吉。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 六二 / 0007册.djvu/491"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-yao-2"
      },
      "smallImage": {
        "id": "h53-image-2",
        "original": "饮食衎衎，不素饱也。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 六二小象 / 0007册.djvu/491"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-image-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "polarity": 1,
      "label": "九三",
      "text": {
        "id": "h53-yao-3",
        "original": "鸿渐于陆，夫征不复，妇孕不育，凶；利御寇。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 九三 / 0007册.djvu/491"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-yao-3"
      },
      "smallImage": {
        "id": "h53-image-3",
        "original": "夫征不复，离群丑也。妇孕不育，失其道也。利用御寇，顺相保也。",
        "notes": [
          "采用电子录文“羣醜”，普通电子对校页相应为“群丑”；保留所见，影印字形与异文待核。"
        ],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 九三小象 / 0007册.djvu/492"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-image-3"
      }
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "polarity": 0,
      "label": "六四",
      "text": {
        "id": "h53-yao-4",
        "original": "鸿渐于木，或得其桷，无咎。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 六四 / 0007册.djvu/492"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-yao-4"
      },
      "smallImage": {
        "id": "h53-image-4",
        "original": "或得其桷，顺以巽也。",
        "notes": [],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
            "locator": "卷9 / 渐 / 六四小象 / 0007册.djvu/492"
          }
        ],
        "reviewId": "review-h53-image-4"
      }
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "polarity": 1,
      "label": "九五",
      "text": {
        "id": "h53-yao-5",
        "original": "鸿渐于陵，妇三岁不孕，终莫之胜，吉。",
        "notes": [
          "采用电子录文“嵗”，普通电子对校页相应为“歲”；保留所见，影印字形与异文待核。"
        ],
        "originalRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "skqs-zhouyi-9-batch6",
